"""Write packages/o3de_lighting/source-index.json from the O3DE checkout.

Every entry names a file and a token; the line is the token's only
occurrence in the file, so no line number is typed by hand. A token
`anchor >>> text` is the first line holding `text` after the anchor's only
line, for lines that repeat (a pass file's "Format" lines). Run it from
anywhere after changing an entry or moving to another O3DE commit:

    python3 packages/o3de_lighting/src/o3de/lighting/source_index.py

The checkout is ../../o3de from the lab's root, or O3DE_SOURCE_DIR.
"""
